---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Contact Us"
	description="Get in touch with the PawsomeFlock team with questions, feedback, corrections, or partnership inquiries."
	icon="📬"
>
	<p>
		We'd love to hear from you — whether it's a question about one of our guides, a correction, a topic
		you'd like us to cover, or a partnership inquiry.
	</p>

	<h2>Email</h2>
	<p>
		The fastest way to reach us is by email: <a href="mailto:pawsomeflock@gmail.com">pawsomeflock@gmail.com</a>
	</p>
	<p>We try to reply to every message within a few business days.</p>

	<h2>What to include</h2>
	<p>To help us respond faster, please let us know:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>If it's about a specific article, the article title or link</li>
		<li>Whether you're reaching out as a reader, a brand/PR contact, or for something else</li>
		<li>Any details that will help us understand your question or feedback</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>A quick note</h2>
	<div class="note-box warm">
		<span class="note-icon">🚨</span>
		<span>
			PawsomeFlock does not offer personalized veterinary advice by email. If your pet is sick, injured,
			or showing symptoms that concern you, please contact a licensed veterinarian or an emergency animal
			hospital directly rather than waiting for a reply here.
		</span>
	</div>
</StaticPage>
